  "body": "Tender: Closes on Friday 30 October 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nWhere Space, Sun & Serenity Meet!\r\n\r\nStep into the ultimate family haven, perfectly positioned on a breathtaking 8,000m² (approx. 2 acres) of elevated freehold land. Here, every sunrise brings promise and every sunset whispers peace – all while offering exceptional potential to secure a second title in the future.\r\n\r\nSolid brick and tile beauty: single-level, timeless construction ensures comfort, durability, and effortless living.\r\n\r\nFive generous bedrooms, including a huge master suite with ensuite, are cleverly designed in separate wings – giving parents and kids the privacy and freedom they crave.\r\n\r\nWith three spacious living areas for hosting lively gatherings or enjoying a quiet evening by the wood-burner fireplace, this home transforms to fit every moment.\r\n\r\nA light-filled conservatory soaks up all-day sun and tranquil views year-round, with tasteful blinds and curtains throughout for effortless elegance.\r\n\r\nDouble Internal Access Garage and Large Parking Pad: Ample off-street parking means there’s always space for guests, toys, and celebrations.\r\n\r\nExpansive outdoor spaces: let your imagination run wild – from garden parties to backyard cricket, there’s room for everyone.\r\n\r\nGaze out to the Weiti River and sanctuary, where native birds and gentle breezes set the scene for daily relaxation.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location:\r\n\r\nOnly 5 minutes to Red Beach or Orewa: splash in the surf, stroll the sand, or dine by the water – your coastal lifestyle is calling.\r\n\r\nWalk to Silverdale Mall and Town Centre: enjoy the convenience of shops, cafes, and amenities just moments from your door.\r\n\r\nA quick 25-minute commute to Auckland City: work in the city, come home to your sanctuary.\r\n\r\nOur vendors are ready for their next chapter and are sincerely motivated to meet the market. This is your chance to secure a rare slice of paradise and a home that truly elevates family living.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss out – contact us today to arrange your private viewing and let your dream begin!",
